# Smoke Master Solution — GitHub Multi-Page Build

This folder is the split static version of the supplied single-file website. The visual CSS, loader, header, footer, WhatsApp enquiry drawer, mobile navigation and content styling are shared across every route.

## Routes

- `/`
- `about/`
- `products/`
- `products/automatic-smoke-curtain/`
- `products/fixed-smoke-curtain/`
- `products/smoke-ventilator-roof-wall/`
- `products/actuator/`
- `products/glass-baffles/`
- `products/customized-steel-structure-design/`
- `services/`
- `services/smoke-curtain-maintenance/`
- `services/professional-engineer-calculation/`
- `projects/`
- `projects/avenue-k-mall/`
- `projects/kl-gateway-mall/`
